      "text": "Notice 1: Community Recreation Center Swimming Pool Guidelines\nThe municipal indoor pool is open daily from 6:00 AM to 9:00 PM. Lap swimming lanes are reserved exclusively for adults between 6:00 AM and 8:30 AM. Children under 12 years of age must be accompanied by an adult supervisor at all times. Appropriate swimwear is mandatory; street clothes and shoes are strictly forbidden on the pool deck. Lockers are available for hire at $2 per day.\n\nNotice 2: Public Library Computer Lab Regulations\nLibrary members may access high-speed internet computers for up to 2 hours per day using their valid library barcode. Printing services cost 15 cents per page for black-and-white documents and 50 cents for color prints. Downloading executable software files or accessing unauthorized streaming sites is strictly prohibited. Users must save personal files onto USB flash drives as system storage is wiped clean every evening.",
