      "text": "Document 1: Corporate Flexible Remote Work Policy\nFull-time staff members who have completed their 6-month probationary period are eligible to apply for a hybrid work schedule allowing up to two remote workdays per week. Applications must be approved by department heads at least two weeks prior to the start of the requested quarter. Remote employees must maintain a dedicated, distraction-free workspace and remain contactable via instant messenger during core working hours (10:00 AM to 4:00 PM). The company provides a one-time ergonomic stipend of $300 for home office setup.\n\nDocument 2: Workplace Health and Safety Incident Reporting Protocol\nIn the event of an occupational injury, chemical spill, or equipment malfunction, the affected employee or witnessing colleague must report the incident to the Onsite Safety Officer within 1 hour. An online Incident Log Form must be completed within 24 hours. For minor injuries requiring first aid treatment, first aid kits are stationed in every kitchen breakroom. Serious medical emergencies require immediate activation of emergency services by dialing 9-9-1-1 on internal landline phones.",
