      "text": "Document 1: Corporate Flexible Hybrid Remote Work Policy\nFull-time staff members who have successfully completed their 6-month probationary review period may apply for a hybrid remote work arrangement allowing up to two remote working days per week. Formal applications must be submitted to department managers at least two weeks prior to the start of each calendar quarter. Approved remote employees must maintain a dedicated, distraction-free home office environment and remain continuously reachable via corporate instant messaging and email during core operational hours (10:00 AM to 4:00 PM). The company provides a one-time ergonomic equipment allowance of $300 toward approved home desk accessories.\n\nDocument 2: Workplace Health, Safety, and Emergency Response Protocols\nIn the event of an occupational injury, chemical spill, or mechanical equipment malfunction, the affected employee or observing colleague must notify the designated Onsite Safety Officer within 1 hour. An official online Incident Log Report must be completed and submitted through the employee portal within 24 hours of the occurrence. For minor cuts and burns requiring immediate first aid treatment, fully stocked first aid kits are located in every kitchen breakroom across all floors. Severe medical emergencies require immediate activation of professional emergency services by dialing 9-9-1-1 on any internal landline extension.",
